 "pdf": "ads8634.pdf",
 "pages": "p.5 (DVDD 1.65-5.25 V), p.6-7 (Table 1: td(CS-DO) 52.5 ns, td(SCLK-DOUT) 51.5 ns, td(CS-DOHZ) 31 ns at 1.8 V; DIN latched on SCLK rising, DOUT on SCLK falling), p.8 (pins), p.26 (Table 4: bipolar 0 V = 800h), p.29-31 (power-down/up by AL_PD and by register, Tables 6-7), p.32-37 (operation, Figure 85, Table 8 DOUT = 4-bit channel address + 12-bit result, Tables 9-10 command word, Figures 89-90), p.50-51 (Tables 13-14 register maps), p.52-59 (register descriptions)",
 "notModeled": [
  "auto-scan mode (AUTO register, AUTO_MD_CH_SEL sequence, RESET_SEQ): stored only; the converted channel is always MANUAL.CH_SEL (manual mode)",
  "channel select latency: the datasheet applies a MANUAL write to the acquisition of frame n+1 (result in frame n+2); the model commits at CS rise and uses it from the next frame",
  "DOUT channel address for the ADS8634 is 0,C1,C0,X (Table 8); X is output as 0. Temperature sensor (SEL_TEMP, address 1111, temperature code): not modeled",
